    "projects.create_hint": "Region determines available cost databases and VAT rates. Classification standard defines the cost structure: DIN 276 for DACH countries, NRM for UK, MasterFormat for US/Canada, UniFormat for Oceania. Currency sets all pricing in the bid schedule.",
