    "tendering.workflow_desc": "Tendering workflow: Draft (prepare package) → Issued (send to bidders) → Collecting (receive bids) → Evaluating (compare offers side-by-side) → Awarded (select winner). Create a package from a bid schedule, add subcontractor bids, then use the comparison table to identify the best offer. Add 2+ bids to see a side-by-side analysis.",
