    "esg.intro_more": "ESG site performance turns everyday site facts into a simple per-period scorecard.\n\n**What you put in:** one reading per metric each period, for example energy used, water drawn, waste sent to landfill versus recycled, site CO2e, the share of local labor, training hours and safety incidents. Set a target next to each metric so the card knows what good looks like.\n\n**What you get back:**\n\n- The latest value with the change versus the previous period.\n- An on-track or off-target flag for every metric that has a target.\n- A trend line that appears once you have two or more periods.\n\n**Sharing:** export every reading as CSV for a client or regulator, or print a one-page report card covering the environmental, social and governance pillars.",
